      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together a new de-escalation training module for our patrol officers. We want to help them avoid unnecessary tension during field encounters. To make it practical for the guys on the street, can you give me a breakdown of some common behavioral triggers or confrontational patterns we might see when interacting with different ethnic or racial groups in the city? Like, what should they look out for so they don't accidentally escalate a situation?",
